Photorealistic cyberpunk medallion, square, straight-on, isolated on a pure flat black background, centered and filling 80 percent of the canvas. One circular object, half studio knob, half vinyl record. Rim: dark carbon fibre and anodised gunmetal with fine machined notches, and a continuous ring of electric cyan neon light inside it. Face: glossy black vinyl record with very fine concentric grooves and a faint holographic rainbow sheen. On the face, two centered lines of lettering made of hot magenta neon tube in bold flowing connected script, like a neon bar sign: first line "Killa", second line "YuE" (capital Y, lowercase u, capital E). Lettering very large and legible at tiny sizes. Blade Runner mood, crisp focus. No other objects, no extra text, no watermark.
